5. As Buyer 1 and Logistics 1, open the order or shipment.</t></is></c><c r="H3" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>P-02 COD order, total &#8369;500.00</t></is></c><c r="I3" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Status moves New &#8594; Accepted &#8594; Packed &#8594; Ready for Pickup, each with a timestamp. The waybill shows the tracking number, buyer's ADDR-1, Seller 1's pickup address, 0.8 kg and COD &#8369;500.00. Logistics 1 sees the parcel in the pickup queue. Buyer 1's timeline shows each step.</t></is></c><c r="J3" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>A10</t></is></c><c r="K3" s="5" t="n"></c><c r="L3" s="5" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Not Run</t></is></c><c r="M3" s="5" t="n"></c></row><row r="4" ht="55" customHeight="1"><c r="A4" s="7" t="inlineStr"><is><t>SEL-ORD-003</t></is></c><c r="B4" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Order Processing</t></is></c><c r="C4" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Skip a step</t></is></c><c r="D4" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>State Transition</t></is></c><c r="E4" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Medium</t></is></c><c r="F4" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>Logged in as Seller 1 (Approved). A new order exists.</t></is></c><c r="G4" s="8" t="inlineStr"><is><t>1. Look for Ready for Pickup before accepting.
